A||||9||DecadenceR||Exhaust / headers||||1||
Z||000000||DecadenceR||06-01-2001||03:52 PM||||I may need to replace my cat to pass the emissions test in NJ. If I do, I wanna do it once and do it right. So I was looking into the header, free flow cat, and borla exhaust.<P>My questions are:<P>has anyone here seen the borla exhaust and heard it? I dont want to sound like a Civic with a soup can...<P>Any advice on the cat?<P>Who makes headers for a 4-banger? I tried e-mailing Pacesetter several times, and they are SOOO good at not replying...||||reg||1
Z||000001||Raydar||06-01-2001||04:14 PM||||AFAIK, Hooker is the only company still building a 4 cyl header. Two different models. Never heard a Borla on a Duke, that I know of.<P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"||||reg||1
